1. INTRODUCTION
第一条  协议概述

JunoYi Pay (hereinafter referred to as the "Software") is an
aggregated payment and cashier system developed and maintained by
Anqing Junyi Network Technology Co., Ltd. (hereinafter referred to
as the "Copyright Owner").

JunoYi Pay（以下简称“本软件”）是由安庆钧逸网络科技有限公司
（以下简称“版权所有者”）开发和维护的聚合支付与收银系统。

This Software adopts a community-use and commercial-licensing model.
Users may use the Software free of charge for eligible non-commercial
purposes. Commercial use requires a valid commercial license.

本软件采用社区免费使用与商业授权相结合的许可模式。
符合条件的非商业用途可以免费使用本软件；商业用途须取得有效的商业授权。

By downloading, installing, copying, modifying, distributing, or
otherwise using the Software, you agree to comply with this License.

下载、安装、复制、修改、分发或以其他方式使用本软件，
即表示您同意遵守本协议。

This License is a custom license and is not an OSI-approved
Open Source License.

本协议属于自定义许可协议，不属于 OSI 认可的标准开源许可证。


