第二条  免费非商业使用

Subject to this License, the Copyright Owner grants eligible users
a limited, non-exclusive, non-transferable license to use the
Software for permitted non-commercial purposes.

在遵守本协议的前提下，版权所有者授予符合条件的用户有限的、
非独占的、不可转让的许可，允许其将本软件用于规定的非商业用途。

2.1 Personal Use
2.1 个人使用

Individuals may use the Software for personal learning, technical
research, testing, experimentation, and other non-commercial purposes.

个人用户可以将本软件用于个人学习、技术研究、功能测试、
技术实验及其他非商业用途。

2.2 Educational Use
2.2 教育用途

Students may use the Software for coursework, academic research,
graduation projects, technical experiments, and other eligible
non-commercial educational activities.

学生可以将本软件用于课程学习、学术研究、毕业设计、
技术实验及其他符合条件的非商业教育活动。

Student status alone does not authorize commercial use.

仅具有学生身份，并不意味着可以免除商业使用授权要求。

2.3 Non-Profit and Charitable Use
2.3 非营利与公益用途

Eligible non-profit organizations, charitable organizations,
and public-benefit organizations may use the Software free of charge
for qualifying charitable, public-benefit, or non-commercial activities.

符合条件的非营利组织、慈善机构及公益组织，可以将本软件
免费用于符合条件的慈善、公益或非商业活动。

The eligibility of an organization and its intended use may be
subject to verification by the Copyright Owner.

版权所有者可以根据组织性质及实际用途核实其免费使用资格。

2.4 Permitted Activities
2.4 允许的活动

Eligible users may, within the scope of their free-use authorization:

符合免费使用条件的用户，可以在授权范围内：

(a) Download, install, and run the Software.
    下载、安装和运行本软件。

(b) Read and study the source code.
    阅读和学习本软件源代码。

(c) Modify the Software for personal learning, research, and testing.
    为个人学习、研究和测试目的修改本软件。

(d) Create copies reasonably necessary for permitted activities.
    为开展获准活动制作合理必要的副本。

(e) Use the Software in other activities expressly permitted
    by this License.
    将本软件用于本协议明确允许的其他活动。

Free-use authorization does not automatically grant commercial
deployment, commercial distribution, paid hosting, or other
commercial rights.

免费使用授权不自动包含商业部署、商业分发、收费托管服务
或其他商业使用权。


3. COMMERCIAL LICENSE
第三条  商业授权

Commercial use requires a valid commercial license issued by
the Copyright Owner, unless otherwise expressly authorized in writing.

除非版权所有者另行书面授权，商业用途必须取得版权所有者
签发的有效商业授权。

3.1 Definition of Commercial Use
3.1 商业用途的定义

Commercial use includes, but is not limited to:

商业用途包括但不限于：

(a) Using the Software in a business operated for profit.
    将本软件用于以营利为目的的经营活动。

(b) Integrating the Software into a commercial product or service.
    将本软件集成到商业产品或服务中。

(c) Developing commercial software or solutions based on the Software.
    基于本软件开发商业软件或解决方案。

(d) Providing paid deployment, hosting, operation, or technical
    services based on the Software.
    基于本软件提供收费部署、托管、运营或技术服务。

(e) Using the Software as part of a paid service offered to customers.
    将本软件作为面向客户提供的收费服务的一部分。

Whether a particular activity constitutes commercial use shall
be determined according to its actual circumstances and the
applicable commercial license terms.

某项活动是否构成商业用途，应根据实际情况及适用的商业授权条款判断。

3.2 One-Time Commercial License
3.2 一次性商业授权

The Copyright Owner may offer commercial licenses on a one-time
payment basis.

版权所有者可以提供一次性付费的商业授权。

After payment and issuance of a valid license, the licensee may
perpetually use the version and within the scope specified in
the applicable commercial license.

被授权人完成付款并取得有效授权后，可以在相应商业授权规定的
范围内永久使用指定版本。

Unless expressly included in the commercial license, a one-time
payment does not automatically include future upgrades, maintenance,
technical support, or custom development.

除非商业授权明确包含，一次性付款不自动包含未来版本升级、
维护、技术支持或定制开发服务。

3.3 Scope of Commercial Authorization
3.3 商业授权范围

The applicable commercial license may specify the authorized entity,
version, deployment scope, permitted use, redistribution rights,
and other relevant conditions.

具体商业授权文件可以规定被授权主体、授权版本、部署范围、
允许的使用方式、再分发权利及其他相关条件。

The licensee must not exceed the scope of the authorization granted.

被授权人不得超出已取得的授权范围使用本软件。


