或停止未经授权的使用。

Where permitted by applicable law, authorization may be terminated
if a material violation is not remedied within a reasonable period
after notice.

在适用法律允许的范围内，重大违约行为在收到通知后未于合理期限内
得到纠正的，相应授权可以终止。

Termination does not affect rights and obligations that accrued
before termination or provisions that are required to survive
